>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yào\" data-defn=\"will; shall; about to / need to; should / if\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">要</span><span class=\"tr\">要</span><rt>yào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎng\" data-defn=\"to desire; to want (to)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"huò dé\" data-defn=\"to obtain; to receive; to get\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">获得</span><span class=\"tr\">獲得</span><rt>huò dé</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shū shì\" data-defn=\"cozy / snug\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">舒适</span><span class=\"tr\">舒適</span><rt>shū shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǔ\" data-defn=\"(formal) and; together with (linking parallel nouns, verbs, or phrases)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">与</span><span class=\"tr\">與</span><rt>yǔ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yōu yǎ\" data-defn=\"grace\" data-hsk=\"HSK 7-9\"><span class=\"si\">优雅</span><span class=\"tr\">優雅</span><rt>yōu yǎ</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xū yào\" data-defn=\"to need; to want; to demand; to require\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">需要</span><span class=\"tr\">需要</span><rt>xū yào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hǎo\" data-defn=\"good / appropriate; proper\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xīn qíng\" data-defn=\"mood; frame of mind\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">心情</span><span class=\"tr\">心情</span><rt>xīn qíng</rt></ruby>。", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu de\" data-defn=\"(there are) some (who are...) / some (exist)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有的</span><span class=\"tr\">有的</span><rt>yǒu de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"rén\" data-defn=\"person; people\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">人</span><span class=\"tr\">人</span><rt>rén</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hěn\" data-defn=\"very; quite\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">很</span><span class=\"tr\">很</span><rt>hěn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xìng yùn\" data-defn=\"fortunate; lucky\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">幸运</span><span class=\"tr\">幸運</span><rt>xìng yùn</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shàng\" data-defn=\"to climb; to get onto; to go up\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">上</span><span class=\"tr\">上</span><rt>shàng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"chē\" data-defn=\"car / vehicle / machine\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">车</span><span class=\"tr\">車</span><rt>chē</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiù\" data-defn=\"merely; nothing else but; simply; just; precisely; exactly\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">就</span><span class=\"tr\">就</span><rt>jiù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zuò\" data-defn=\"seat\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">座</span><span class=\"tr\">座</span><rt>zuò</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu de\" data-defn=\"(there are) some (who are...) / some (exist)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有的</span><span class=\"tr\">有的</span><rt>yǒu de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"rén\" data-defn=\"person; people\" data-h